# Phase 6A checks for reservations: the lists and the detail, the booking form (an event and an equipment
# rental), the customer's cancel and change request, and the rental stock on a date (VS Code REST Client:
# click "Send Request" above a block). Start the API first (npm run dev:api) and load the sample data
# (npm run seed:api). The bookings made here stay in the database: run npm run seed:api again afterwards.
#
# The customer requests need a customer token and the admin requests an admin token: get them with the
# sign-in requests at the top of catalog.http, and paste them into @customerToken and @adminToken below.
# Dates are counted from today ({{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}} is 45 days from now), so they stay in the
# future; pick another offset if that day is blocked or already has an event.
# Errors come back as { code, message, meta }; meta.field names the form input the message belongs to.

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@customerToken = paste-a-customer-token
@adminToken = paste-an-admin-token
@ref = RES-2026-1006-01

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: reads

### The signed-in customer's bookings, newest first. Never the admin's private notes.
GET {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### One of the customer's own bookings in full (package, menu, add-ons, payments, review).
### Another customer's booking is 404 NOT_FOUND, never 403.
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Rental stock on a date: { itemId: { left, status } }, status available / limited / out.
### No date: {}. A day that does not exist: 400 INVALID, meta.field "date"
GET {{api}}/rentals/availability?date={{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: booking form

### A buffet: 201 with the new booking's summary (status pending, estimate = package + guests x the price per person).
### A blocked or full date: 409 DATE_UNAVAILABLE; an overlapping start time: 409 TIME_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-1",
  "serviceType": "Buffet and Catering",
  "eventName": "Santos Family Reunion",
  "occasion": "Reunion",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}",
  "startTime": "17:00",
  "guests": 120,
  "menu": { "pork": "Lechon kawali", "chicken": "Chicken inasal", "fish": "Sweet and sour fish", "vegetable": "Chopsuey" },
  "foodNotes": "One vegetarian table",
  "addonIds": ["add-waiters"],
  "addonQty": { "add-waiters": 3 },
  "venueName": "Barangay Hall",
  "venueAddress": "Poblacion",
  "city": "Malvar, Batangas",
  "accessNotes": ""
}

### An equipment rental picked up at our place: 201. More pieces than are free that day: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK, meta.field "rental.<itemId>"
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-equipment-rental",
  "eventName": "Backyard birthday",
  "occasion": "Birthday",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 46 d}}",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "fulfilment": "pickup",
  "rentalItems": [{ "itemId": "inv-001", "qty": 50 }]
}

### Guests out of range: 400 INVALID "Guests must be between 50 and 2000.", meta.field "guests"
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "packageId": "pkg-1", "serviceType": "Catering only", "eventName": "Too small", "occasion": "Birthday", "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}", "startTime": "12:00", "guests": 10, "venueName": "Hall", "venueAddress": "1 St", "city": "Lipa" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: cancel and change request

### Cancel (only while Pending or Approved): the summary with status "cancelled".
### A payment still being verified: 409 PENDING_PAYMENT; a confirmed booking: 409 INVALID_STATE
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "We moved the celebration to next year." }

### Ask for a change: "Change request: …" in the customer's chat, unread for the admin -> { threadId }
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}/change-request
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Please change the guest count from 150 to 170." }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin

### Every booking, newest first (with the admin's notes). A customer's token here: 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{api}}/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### One booking in full
GET {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rental stock with the booking being edited left out (excludeRef counts for an admin only)
GET {{api}}/rentals/availability?date={{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}&excludeRef={{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
